<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">代课数：替人代上的课为代课，代课者不足常规课时<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>节的先抵足课时，超过部分按实际数计算；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>5.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">课时总量：正常工作月份课时总数<SPAN lang=EN-US>=</SPAN>课时数<SPAN lang=EN-US>*4.3</SPAN>周；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
