<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">行政值班（周）：<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>小时<SPAN lang=EN-US>60</SPAN>元、<SPAN lang=EN-US>24</SPAN>小时<SPAN lang=EN-US>120</SPAN>元；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">节假日加班值班：半天<SPAN lang=EN-US>50</SPAN>元、一天<SPAN lang=EN-US>100</SPAN>元。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
