<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">七、高三节假日补课补贴</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">（职能部门：教学处、年级组）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
