<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>1. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">教研组长每月津贴<SPAN lang=EN-US>400</SPAN>元，备课组长每月津贴<SPAN lang=EN-US>250</SPAN>元（同时兼任教研组长和备课组长的，不累计计算补贴，按最高项计），其中每月<SPAN lang=EN-US>100</SPAN>元由教科室考核后在期末分<SPAN lang=EN-US>A</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>B</SPAN>两个等次发放，余额每月固定发放；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">中层正职每月津贴<SPAN lang=EN-US>900</SPAN>元，副职每月津贴<SPAN lang=EN-US>700</SPAN>元，年级长每月津贴<SPAN lang=EN-US>700</SPAN>元，其中每月<SPAN lang=EN-US>200</SPAN>元在期末考核后分<SPAN lang=EN-US>A</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>B</SPAN>两个等次发放，余额每月固定发放；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">支部书记每月津贴<SPAN lang=EN-US>150</SPAN>元，其中每月<SPAN lang=EN-US>50</SPAN>元由校党委考核后发放，余额每月固定发放；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">所有享受津贴的管理岗位在方案通过后由学校组织公开竞聘；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoBodyText align=left><FONT size=5><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN>5.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">根据绍兴市机构编制委员会办公室《关于同意调整部分市属学校内设处室名称等事宜的批复》（绍市编办〔<SPAN lang=EN-US>2018</SPAN>〕<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>号），我校中层岗位可设置为<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>正<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>副，下学期始调整为：党政办<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>正<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>副，教学处、德育处、总务处各<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>正<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>副，教科室、安全处、信息处各<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>正（具体根据上级最新的“三定”方案设定）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">第五条<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>按月、季预发的年度绩效考核奖</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">（职能部门：各处室）<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">按月、季预发的年度绩效考核奖根据上级部门的现行政策，通过考核发放，其中，出勤考核与按月预发的年度绩效考核奖挂钩，学期绩效考核与按季预发的年度绩效考核奖挂钩。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">教职工正常出勤，当月没有无故迟到、早退等现象，工作认真、服从学校安排者，经考核预发<SPAN lang=EN-US>1600</SPAN>元<SPAN lang=EN-US>/</SPAN>月。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">有下列行为之一者，相应扣除本月绩效考核奖：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">对有违反师德师风行为以及其他违反职业道德和《事业单位工作人员处分暂行规定》行为的，视情节轻重和影响程度，党政工联席会议集体讨论扣发部分或全部按月预发的年度绩效考核奖；<SPAN lang=EN-US> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">上班、集会、升旗、值周、上课等无故迟到（早退）者，每次扣<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>元；无故缺岗者，每次扣<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>元；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">监考迟到、不遵守监考守则，每次扣<SPAN lang=EN-US>50</SPAN>元；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">不遵守教学常规和后勤教辅岗位工作纪律，学生、家长有投诉者，查实后每例扣<SPAN lang=EN-US>150</SPAN>元；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>5.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">无故旷工旷课和旷夜自修管理，每次扣<SPAN lang=EN-US>100</SPAN>元，造成教学事故者，每次扣<SPAN lang=EN-US>200</SPAN>元；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>6.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">一年内事假超过累计<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>天和病假超过累计<SPAN lang=EN-US>14</SPAN>天的，超过部分事假每天扣<SPAN lang=EN-US>100</SPAN>元、病假每天扣<SPAN lang=EN-US>50</SPAN>元。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">按季预发的年度绩效考核奖，按<SPAN lang=EN-US>A</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>B</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>C</SPAN>三个等次发放，由学校根据考核结果确定等次的比例和奖励的额度，初定为<SPAN lang=EN-US>A</SPAN>等<SPAN lang=EN-US>7600</SPAN>元、<SPAN lang=EN-US>B</SPAN>等<SPAN lang=EN-US>7200</SPAN>元、<SPAN lang=EN-US>C</SPAN>等<SPAN lang=EN-US>6800</SPAN>元。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">凡教师被查实有有偿补课、收受礼品礼金、体罚学生等师德失范行为的，扣发该学期按季预发的年度绩效考核奖。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">第六条<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>年终结算的年度绩效考核奖（</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">职能部门：各处室）<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">根据市人力社保局、市财政局核定的市直学校年度绩效考核奖总额考核发放，有下列情况者执行以下办法：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">①事业单位人员在市直学校（单位）之间调动的，按调动工作前后实际工作月份发放考核奖；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">②其他调动人员、转业复退军人和退休人员，可根据其本年度的实际工作月份，计算发放年度绩效考核奖；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">③试用期内不预发考核奖，从试用期满定级的当月起预发放年度绩效考核奖；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">④请病假不足<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>个月和请哺乳假的人员，按实际工作月份预发放年度绩效考核奖；请事假累计在<SPAN lang=EN-US>20 </SPAN>天以上、<SPAN lang=EN-US>30 </SPAN>天以下（含<SPAN lang=EN-US>30 </SPAN>天）的人员，年度绩效考核奖减半预发放；当年事假累计超过<SPAN lang=EN-US>30 </SPAN>天、当年病假累计超过<SPAN lang=EN-US>6 </SPAN>个月的人员不发年度绩效考核奖。之前已经预发放的，自超过规定期限起停止预发放，预发部分一个月内清退；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">⑤年度考核为基本合格、不合格以及其他不参加年度考核或参加年度考核不定考核等次的工作人员不发年度绩效考核奖，已经预发的一个月内清退。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">年度绩效考核奖分优秀、合格（含部分扣发）和基本合格、不合格等三类结果。基本合格、不合格者不发年度绩效考核奖。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">确定为优秀的教职工，按照<SPAN lang=EN-US>1.05</SPAN>的系数发放；其他有按规定扣发者，按照<SPAN lang=EN-US>1.0</SPAN>系数按实扣发后进行。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">按季预发的年度绩效考核奖和年终结算的年度绩效考核奖由学校根据实际情况制定具体实施细则，报市教育局审批后按季（学期）和年度发放。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">第七条<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>校级领导绩效考核与计发 <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">校领导绩效工资和年度绩效考核奖金根据市教育局《关于进一步完善市直学校绩效工资和年度绩效考核奖分配工作的意见》（绍市教政〔<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>〕<SPAN lang=EN-US>56</SPAN>号）文件执行。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 43.55pt; MARGIN: 6pt 0cm; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 2.71" class=MsoNormal align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">第三章<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>附则<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">第八条</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">全校教工的绩效明细和市三名奖励明细进行公示公布。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">第九条</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">本实施办法及相应的实施细则由校长室负责解释，经学校教代会通过并报绍兴市教育局审批后实施。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: right; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=right><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: right; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=right><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
